  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added the `endUnits` top-level post manifest key in `crates/post/src/post/end_units.rs` (`\"<inch_word> <mm_word>\"`, `\"note\"`, or absent) and checked `end_units::refusal` in `crates/post/src/post/engine.rs` before any hook runs.\n- Added `endUnits = \"G20 G21\"` to `tormach.cps`, `grblhal.cps`, `tinyg.cps`, `fanuc.cps`, `mazak.cps`, and `doosan-dnm.cps`.\n- Added `endUnitsWord()` in `fanuc.cps`, `mazak.cps`, and `doosan-dnm.cps` so `onClose()` writes `G20` or `G21` right before `M30` after the final retract when `postOptions.EndUnits` asks to switch.\n- Added `endUnits = \"G700 G710\"` and `endUnitsWord()` to `sinumerik.cps` so `onClose()` writes `G700` or `G710` right before `M2` after `G53` when `postOptions.EndUnits` asks to switch.\n- Added `endUnits = \"note\"` and `noteEndUnits()` to `haas.cps`, `carvera.cps`, and `heidenhain.cps` so they emit a one-time `END UNITS NOT WRITTEN ...` note instead of switching units or failing silently (Haas G20/G21 alarms against Setting 9; Carvera halts on G20; Heidenhain post is mm-only).\n- Undeclared scripts (lathes, plasma, wire/sinker EDM, and custom scripts without `endUnits`) now refuse `EndUnits` by post name before any hook runs.\n- Added `posting::end_units_words` in `crates/app/src/posting_units.rs` and gated the End units selector in both the Post dialog (`post_dialog.rs`, `post_dialog_tabs.rs`) and `Setup -> Post` (`post_options.rs::end_units_picker`) to posts that declare unit words, using their declared word labels and showing a one-click reset when an unsupported post carries a non-`Leave` value.\n- Updated `assets/posts/AGENTS.md` and added `docs/decisions/2189-end-units-posts.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nOnly `tormach.cps`, `grblhal.cps`, and `tinyg.cps` read `postOptions.EndUnits`. Seven other shipped mill posts silently ignored it, `post_options::end_units_picker` checked only `\"Tormach PathPilot\"`, and the Post dialog offered `\"Inch (G20)\"` / `\"mm (G21)\"` on every post including `sinumerik` (`G700`/`G710`) and non-switching posts.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins added:\n  - `writing_mill_posts_emit_end_unit_word_before_program_end` (`crates/post/tests/end_units.rs`) - red before fix (`fanuc` missed `G20`), green across all 7 switching mill posts after fix.\n  - `non_switching_mill_posts_note_end_units_once` (`crates/post/tests/end_units.rs`) - red before fix (`haas` missed note), green across `haas`, `carvera`, `heidenhain` after fix.\n  - `undeclared_post_refuses_end_units_by_name` (`crates/post/tests/end_units.rs`) - red before fix (no refusal), green after fix.\n  - `every_builtin_handles_or_refuses_end_units_by_name` (`crates/app/tests/tormach_end_units.rs`) - green (`8 passed; 0 failed` in `tormach_end_units`).\n  - `dialog_and_post_page_offer_end_units_only_for_supported_posts` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_dialog_tests.rs`) - red before fix (`Setup -> Post` missed `Builtin`), green after fix.\n  - Unit tests in `crates/post/src/post/end_units.rs` (`parses_end_units_option_and_manifest`, `refuses_undeclared_script_only_when_end_units_asked`) - green.\n- Mutations verified (reverted to `upstream/main`, pin failed, restored, pin passed):\n  - `crates/post/src/post/engine.rs` (`undeclared_post_refuses_end_units_by_name`).\n  - `fanuc.cps`, `mazak.cps`, `doosan-dnm.cps`, `sinumerik.cps` (`writing_mill_posts_emit_end_unit_word_before_program_end`).\n  - `haas.cps`, `carvera.cps`, `heidenhain.cps` (`non_switching_mill_posts_note_end_units_once`).\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_dialog_tabs.rs` and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_options.rs` (`dialog_and_post_page_offer_end_units_only_for_supported_posts`).\n- Quick gate & clippy:\n  - `cargo run -p xtask -- gate quick --base upstream/main`: `post suites` (64 binaries) passed (46s), `ui suites` (7 binaries) passed (21s), `app suites` passed 210 of 211 binaries (548s); `first_4axis_part::the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program` failed on pre-existing `upstream/main` `e3ca44fa7` stamp v3 mismatch (`#2198`, PR `#2200`).\n  - `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp_post_options`: 5 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (0 warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\nPhysical CNC controls; interactive desktop binary; release-tier heavy/ignored suites (`quick` gate ran unit + targeted integration suites only).\n\n## Overlaps\n\nTouches shared files on different functions/manifest lines with open PRs `#468`, `#1681`, `#1738`, `#1821`, `#2048`, `#2115`, `#2136`, `#2140`, `#2149`, `#2162`, `#2202`, `#2203`; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: high\nChangelog: Honor, note once, or refuse end_units across all posts and gate UI end-unit pickers by post capability\nFixes #2189\n## UI evidence for the review\n\nThese images show the Post dialog and the Setup → Post page.\nFor the before images, `post_dialog_tabs.rs` and `post_options.rs` use their versions from `e3ca44fa705d71438a8fd8a8efccbafcc2b6517f`.\nAll other source stays at the PR head.\nThe after images use PR head `3b71ebd9e920ef0060400b4757f6bd3063f7c911`.\nThe images show the production controls in an egui test harness.\nA temporary CPU renderer drew the egui meshes and font textures.\nGPU capture failed with `No adapter found`. These are headless UI renders.\nThe Siemens views open the selector to show both unit words.\nThe unsupported-post views use Fanuc Lathe with `EndUnits::Inch`.\nThe images are on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch.\nNo image is in this PR branch.\n\n| View and state | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Post dialog, Siemens 840D unit labels | ![Post dialog Siemens before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/before-post-dialog-siemens.png) | ![Post dialog Siemens after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/after-post-dialog-siemens.png) |\n| Post dialog, unsupported post with an EndUnits value | ![Post dialog unsupported post before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/before-post-dialog-unsupported.png) | ![Post dialog unsupported post after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/after-post-dialog-unsupported.png) |\n| Setup → Post, Siemens 840D unit labels | ![Setup Post Siemens before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/before-setup-post-siemens.png) | ![Setup Post Siemens after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/after-setup-post-siemens.png) |\n| Setup → Post, unsupported post with an EndUnits value | ![Setup Post unsupported post before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/before-setup-post-unsupported.png) | ![Setup Post unsupported post after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/e8eb4073dea3d43927a400c82bb818c6e698bb1d/2208/after-setup-post-unsupported.png) |\n\nThe Siemens controls use `G700` and `G710` after the change.\nAn unsupported post shows the reset action when it has an EndUnits value other than `Leave`.\n\n",
